# E05 Vickrey auction: parallel; the valuations come from the seed of the oracle, every bidder bids once. Compared: the
# valuations and the result (winner and second price), the messages each bidder receives in order, and all the messages
# as a multiset (the only fact that shows the name of a sender).
ignore ^$
cover all
fact valuation ^\[(bidder\d+)\]: My valuation is (\d+)$
fact finished ^\[auctioneer\]: Auction finished\. (.*)$
fact won ^\[(bidder\d+)\]: I have won\.$
fact to_bidder ^\t\[\w+ -> (bidder\d+)\]: (.*)$
fact message ^\t\[(\w+) -> (\w+)\]: (.*)$
same valuation bag
same finished seq
same won seq
same to_bidder seq by 0
same message bag
check valuation count == 5
check finished count == 1
check won count == 1
